type: software
title: "Injury-centre endothelium shifts towards a procoagulant venous state in traumatic brain injury: analysis code and de-identified summary tables"
abstract: "Analysis code and de-identified summary tables for a clinical cohort, blood transcriptomic and single-cell virtual-perturbation study of deep-vein thrombosis after traumatic brain injury with lower-limb fracture. No patient-level data are included."
